    "title": "MICROSERVICE-PROD-Create Trade Banking Letter Of Credit-spec",
    "description": "The Trade Banking Letter of Credit API facilitates the creation and management of letters of credit, essential financial instruments that guarantee payment to suppliers. This API allows businesses to streamline the process of issuing these documents, providing features such as submission of relevant details and tracking of application status. Typical consumers include banking institutions and trade companies looking to optimize their financing operations. By utilizing this endpoint, users can enhance operational efficiency and reduce transaction risks in international trade.",
